### 1. Get all bookings (Starts empty: 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/bookings

### 2. Create a valid booking (Expected: 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "EV001",
  "participantName": "Rahim Gonzalez",
  "participantEmail": "rahim@example.com",
  "seats": 2
}

### 3. Verify event availableSeats reduced from 120 to 118 (Expected: 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/events/EV001

### 4. Get one specific booking by ID (Expected: 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/bookings/BK001

### 5. Create booking with missing fields (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "",
  "participantName": "Rahim Gonzalez",
  "participantEmail": "",
  "seats": 0
}

### 6. Create booking with unknown event ID (Expected: 404 Not Found)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "EV999",
  "participantName": "Rahim Gonzalez",
  "participantEmail": "rahim@example.com",
  "seats": 2
}

### 7. Create booking exceeding event availability threshold (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "EV002",
  "participantName": "Rahim Gonzalez",
  "participantEmail": "rahim@example.com",
  "seats": 100
}

### 8. OPTIONAL TASK: Cancel the booking via ID (Expected: 200 OK)
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/bookings/BK001

### 9. Verify seats were added back from 118 to 120 after cancellation (Expected: 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/events/EV001